# QuanLyNhaThuoc - Pharmacy Management System

## Project Overview
Laravel 12-based pharmacy management system with comprehensive inventory tracking, order management, and audit logging capabilities.

## Tech Stack
- **Framework**: Laravel 12 (PHP 8.2+)
- **Database**: SQLite (dev), MySQL/PostgreSQL (production)
- **Frontend**: Laravel Breeze, Blade templates, Vite
- **Authentication**: Laravel Breeze with role-based access

## Core Features
- Product catalog with categories, batch tracking, expiration dates
- FEFO (First Expired, First Out) inventory strategy
- Shopping cart with real-time validation
- Multi-step checkout process
- Order management with status workflows
- Admin dashboard with analytics
- Complete audit trail system
- Vietnamese localization

## Architecture Pattern
**MVC with Service Layer**
- Controllers handle HTTP requests/responses
- Services contain business logic
- Models represent data and relationships
- Middleware for security and auditing

## Key Directories
```
app/
├── Http/Controllers/     # Request handlers (Admin, Auth, Public)
├── Models/              # Eloquent models with relationships
├── Services/            # Business logic layer
├── Middleware/          # Security & audit middleware
├── Traits/              # Reusable behaviors (Auditable)
├── Helpers/             # Utility functions (Vietnamese)
└── View/Components/     # Blade components
```

## Business Rules
- FEFO inventory strategy for expiration management
- Order status workflow: Pending → Delivering → Completed/Cancelled
- Only Pending orders can be cancelled
- Inventory restored on order cancellation
- All admin operations logged with full audit trail
- Products soft-deleted for data retention
